{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the \u300a<i>Dream Strikers\u300b</i> Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will experience the game's core mechanics and essential content. Approximate playtime: 20 minutes. Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;VS Mode&gt;</i></strong> <br>Supports local 1v1 battles. Fight your friends in real-time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Single Player Mode&gt;</i></strong> <br>Choose your favorite character and challenge handcrafted AI in a multi-stage arcade mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Leaderboard Challenge&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks in Arcade Challenge Mode. Mix and match characters and stages to push your limits and leave your own legendary mark!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes 4 unique playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 8 dreamlike stages with themes like sky, ruins, and city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience high-mobility combat and flashy finishers in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Join our Discord to share feedback and suggestions.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If you encounter any bugs during gameplay, please report them to us. Thank you!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/ezgif-3cff8260704b87.gif?t=1755056766\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/aa542f70617b318d76229ddc3d2411b0.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Strikers</strong> is a <strong>stylish 3D action fighting game</strong> that\u2019s easy to pick up yet deep to master. Featuring high-mobility combat and flashy combo effects, players can choose their side and battle across cyber-fantasy arenas where dodging and chaining attacks combine into intense combat moments. Whether in solo arcade challenges or local 1v1 battles, each match delivers fast-paced, accessible action. Every fight is a clash of conviction and obsession.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.poster.avif?t=1755056766\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/5581a1c5e5ef441e955c9d1b31a9c650.webm?t=1755056766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/0a59f09a4798bcb99d99285251806fc8.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game boasts stunning visual performance\u2014from dynamic facial animations and combat lighting effects to intricate scene details, all designed to deliver realism and impact. With high-end rendering, every battle feels like a cinematic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.poster.avif?t=1755056766\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/98ca14a75844d1b59fa4b322fcd8ed16.webm?t=1755056766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/05cfaa5018bfbd661a4c90ef0e0fdc76.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional fighters, <strong>Dream Strikers</strong> features a dual camera system that dynamically switches between 2D and 3D perspectives, preserving combo freedom while highlighting movement and action detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/ezgif-792d868dc3ddca.gif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/d1e1464c1c4307ef755a0eee7fb0fb6c.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moment is right, unleash your power with <strong>Ultimate Finishers</strong>\u2014high-impact cinematic attacks that can turn the tide in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/d1789e174ab69160451e76a7c5905bc8.poster.avif?t=1755056766\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/d1789e174ab69160451e76a7c5905bc8.webm?t=1755056766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/ea867da7d1b9470514885bed14ba891d.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system <strong>encourages players to freely combine skills based on the flow of battle</strong>, allowing for unique styles and strategies. Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned player, there\u2019s depth to explore, and each character brings distinct mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/\u5716\u72475.gif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/extras/74d6bc69f9b248686d6e6b087230f6ca.avif?t=1755056766\" width=1232 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse cast of characters, each with unique stories and fighting styles, players will experience a world full of challenges and emotion. As the narrative unfolds, uncover hidden truths and confront the nightmares that lurk in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824660?t=1755056766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/650c3a0e2fc1a862e5156bed8199ac135fe03603/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755056766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/d9179cdb7c9070328221a58ae850827a3148d175/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755056766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824660/d9179cdb7c9070328221a58ae850827a3148d175/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755056766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the \u300a<i>Dream Strikers\u300b</i> Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you will experience the game's core mechanics and essential content. Approximate playtime: 20 minutes. Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;VS Mode&gt;</i></strong> <br>Supports local 1v1 battles. Fight your friends in real-time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Single Player Mode&gt;</i></strong> <br>Choose your favorite character and challenge handcrafted AI in a multi-stage arcade mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Leaderboard Challenge&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks in Arcade Challenge Mode. Mix and match characters and stages to push your limits and leave your own legendary mark!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes 4 unique playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 8 dreamlike stages with themes like sky, ruins, and city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience high-mobility combat and flashy finishers in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Join our Discord to share feedba